 "description": "MenuFit is your personalized guide to eating out without sacrificing your goals. Whether you\u2019re cutting or bulking, we tell you exactly what to order at every restaurant \u2014 fast food, dine-in, or even bars.\n\n\u2022 Discover the best meals for your goals\n\u2022 Get meal suggestions from restaurants around the world\n\u2022 Instantly find what to order and what to avoid\n\u2022 Personalized by your preferences, goals, and dietary needs\n\u2022 AI chat assistant ready to answer anything about the menu\n\u2022 Works even if the menu has no calories or macros listed\n\u2022 Get options for food and drinks, including alcohol (based on your age)\n\u2022 Always know what to order \u2014 guilt-free.\n\nUnlock your full potential with personalized meals tailored to your health and fitness goals. Our app requires a subscription to access the complete experience, including all premium features and full meal plans.\n\nBefore subscribing, you'll get a limited selection of meals, carefully crafted to give you a clear idea of the quality and variety we offer. These sample meals help you understand how our plans are designed to support your journey and achieve your desired results.\n\nSubscribe to explore your personalized meal path and take the next step toward your wellness goals.\n\n*PREMIUM / PAID FEATURES INCLUDE (Subscription Required):\n- Discover meals that match your food preferences and macro goals\n- Receive daily meal suggestions tailored to your preferences\n- Access smart calorie breakdowns including protein, carbs, and fats\n- Explore meals from your favorite restaurants and see what fits your goals\n- Healthify any meal to better align with goal\n- Start exploring your next favorite meal today \u2014 and take the guesswork out of eating well!\n\nTerms of Use\nhttps://koscodigital.com/terms-and-conditions/\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\nPrivacy Policy \nhttps://koscodigital.com/privacy-policy/",
